      "q": {
        "en": "In a right-angled triangle, sin θ = 3/5. Find the value of cos θ.",
        "as": "এটা সমকোণী ত্ৰিভূজত, sin θ = 3/5। cos θ ৰ মান নিৰ্ণয় কৰা।"
      },
      "options": {
        "en": [
          "(a) 3/4",
          "(b) 3/5",
          "(c) 4/5",
          "(d) 5/4"
        ],
        "as": [
          "(ক) 3/4",
          "(খ) 3/5",
          "(গ) 4/5",
          "(ঘ) 5/4"
        ]
      },
      "correct": "c",
      "a": {
        "en": [
          "Given sin θ = 3/5, so opposite = 3, hypotenuse = 5.",
          "By Pythagoras, adjacent = √(5² − 3²) = √(16) = 4.",
          "cos θ = 4/5",
          "Answer: 4/5"
